# =============================================================================
# Agent Ignore File (.agentignore / .cursorignore / .ignore)
# Excludes libraries, binary caches, and generated files from agent context
# to prevent token exhaustion and eliminate input complexity.
# =============================================================================

# Third-party Dependencies & Virtual Environments
node_modules/
**/node_modules/**
.venv/
**/.venv/**
venv/
**/venv/**

# .NET Binary & Compilation Artifacts
**/bin/**
**/obj/**
.vs/**

# Web Build Outputs & Bundles
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.vite/**
**/.next/**

# Flutter & Dart Compilation & Cache Artifacts
**/.dart_tool/**
**/android/.gradle/**
**/android/app/build/**
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies

# Python Bytecode & Test Caches
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Generated Dependency Tree Lock Files (Zero business logic, massive token size)
package-lock.json
**/package-lock.json
pubspec.lock
**/pubspec.lock

# System & Log Files
**/*.log
.git/**
